#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:5
#: 4222035177ad4a2ca0edaac37b1e9d1d
msgid "Object Avoidance"
msgstr "避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:7
#: dd74f370f4cc4818b8e60c9d546eb2c4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports several kinds of object avoidance. Avoidance of "
"Airborne Vehicles (ADSB) and Object Avoidance (Object/Ground/Ceiling)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持多种避障方式：空中飞行器规避（ADSB）和物体避障（物体/地面/天花板）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:9
#: 4274ab29a96d469cb5414c1c0be68cf0
msgid ""
"Supported types vary with vehicle (Plane only supports ADSB). Some kinds "
"of avoidance require external hardware, such as ADSB receivers or  "
"Rangefinders."
msgstr "支持的类型因飞行器而异（固定翼仅支持 ADSB）。某些避障类型需要外部硬件，例如 ADSB 接收机或测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:12
#: c7db24e5654443a8b63ccfd55fea7357
msgid "Avoidance Strategies"
msgstr "规避策略"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:14
#: 8cfddeb221fc4c5bad56fb61bb2afbdb
msgid ""
"Various strategies are employed and vary depending on vehicle, mode, "
"and/or object to be avoided. Re-routing, slide, stop, or failsafe style "
"actions are the most common ones. See the particular Avoidance Feature "
"below for details."
msgstr "根据飞行器、模式和/或需规避的物体，采用不同策略。重新路由、滑移、停止或失控保护式动作是最常见的。详情请参阅以下各避障功能说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:19
